    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Nassim est en premi\u00e8re dans un grand lyc\u00e9e parisien et semble aussi insouciant que ses copains. Personne ne se doute qu\u2019en r\u00e9alit\u00e9, il vient de perdre sa m\u00e8re et rentre chaque soir dans un foyer. Malgr\u00e9 la bienveillance de la directrice, il refuse d\u2019\u00eatre assimil\u00e9 aux jeunes de ce centre. Tel un funambule, Nassim navigue entre ses deux vies, qui ne doivent \u00e0 aucun prix se rencontrer...",
        "english": "When Nassim, 16, is placed in Madame Cousin\u2019s foster care in the social projects, he refuses to be assimilated with the other lowlife residents. He invents himself a whole other life, one that is more alike the wealthy teenagers from the Paris high-school he still goes to. His two contradicted lives, at the foster care and at high-school, must never meet."
